{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone in the middle of nowhere, surrounded by an endless forest and unsettling sounds in the distance. Your goal is simple: find a way out without being eaten alive. Survival isn\u2019t guaranteed \u2014 fear, hunger, and thirst are just as deadly as what hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fog-choked world filled with danger and mystery. Craft improvised weapons to defend yourself, navigate twisting mazes hidden deep in the woods, and interact with the environment to uncover the pieces needed to repair a broken radio. Every choice matters, and every sound could mean something is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tense survival experience featuring a large explorable map, environmental interactions, resource management, and sudden jump scares. Stay alert, manage your hunger and thirst, and survive long enough to discover how you ended up here\u2026 and if escape is even possible.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1311460?t=1768165522","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1311460?t=1768165522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311460/4ae5a344a2a454a7465e65334fefa81ef99a1bca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768165522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311460/4ae5a344a2a454a7465e65334fefa81ef99a1bca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768165522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone in the middle of nowhere, surrounded by an endless forest and unsettling sounds in the distance. Your goal is simple: find a way out without being eaten alive. Survival isn\u2019t guaranteed \u2014 fear, hunger, and thirst are just as deadly as what hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fog-choked world filled with danger and mystery. Craft improvised weapons to defend yourself, navigate twisting mazes hidden deep in the woods, and interact with the environment to uncover the pieces needed to repair a broken radio. Every choice matters, and every sound could mean something is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tense survival experience featuring a large explorable map, environmental interactions, resource management, and sudden jump scares. Stay alert, manage your hunger and thirst, and survive long enough to discover how you ended up here\u2026 and if escape is even possible.</p>","developers":["Pasha Bin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1311460/48398c10ca650e69af5bbd7decfbf98288c4e2a8/header.jpg?t=1768165522","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1311460/780885104/33bb9f54942777d8edb13d67633efde03722b444/1768083203/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768083657","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1311460/780885104/33bb9f54942777d8edb13d67633efde03722b444/1768083203/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768083657","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1311460/780885104/33bb9f54942777d8edb13d67633efde03722b444/1768083203/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768083657","id":257262866,"name":"gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257262866/930c3b68e0aaeb18aaa6fa9d3ad704c59f24b2b0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768083657"}],"name":"Lost Alone","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Lost Al